    id: Artefact_Keris
    itemName: Kris
    itemDescription: The kris, with its sinuous, snakelike blade, is the most characteristic
      weapon of Indonesia. Considered from early times to be imbued with great spiritual
      power, it is still an integral part of Indonesian culture.
